abstract: "An open, versioned register of how twelve jurisdictions regulate stablecoins, maintained by Yunjie Fan as independent research. Each record describes one proposition about a jurisdiction, instrument and dimension and includes fields for its source, date, binding status and review status. The dataset is licensed CC BY 4.0 and the code is licensed Apache-2.0."
